# Deck generation

When creating or editing files in `decks/`, follow `.cursor/skills/generate-deck/SKILL.md`.

1. **Copy presets** from `presets/` — never invent title or footer layout.
2. **Replace text only** — do not change structure, classes, stylesheets, `data-slot`, or `../../` asset paths.
3. **Set `slides.json.brand`** to a folder name under `brands/`.
4. **Compile** after edits: `node scripts/compile-deck.js decks/{deck-name}`. If composite component HTML changed, run `node scripts/refresh-components.js decks/{deck-name}` first.

## File layout

```
decks/{deck-name}/
  slides.json
  {slug}-logo.svg
  {slug}-logo-inverted.svg
  01.html
  02.html
```

## Presets that exist

- Title: `presets/title-slides/title-slide-01.html` … `title-slide-04.html` (and matching `*-with-attribution.html`)
- Chapter: `presets/chapter-slides/chapter-slide-01.html`, `chapter-slide-02.html`
- Content: `presets/content-slides/content-slide-3-cards.html` (includes `<slide-footer>`)
- Card fragment: `design-system/components/card/card.html`
- Slide footer fragment: `design-system/components/slide-footer/slide-footer.html`

`slides.json` `title` and `brand` are preserved on compile; `slides` is rewritten from the folder (sorted by filename).
